# Allow-list: send only what the app needs to the build, so personal data (real CVs in
# docs/applications/, the SQLite DB in data/, the API key in .env) can never end up in the image,
# even if a new private folder is added later and nobody remembers to list it here.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!app/
!src/
!samples/
!docs/rubric.json
!docs/01-interviewer-guideline.md

# Belt and braces: never these, even inside an allowed folder.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/data/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[oc]
**/.DS_Store
